{"s":[[null,1,[["p",["Seafoam Pudding is a ",["l","烹饪","cooked dish"],". It is prepared using either the kitchen inside an upgraded ",["l","农舍","farmhouse"]," or a ",["l","野炊工具","Cookout Kit"],". One can be purchased for 5,000g from the shop at the ",["l","月光水母起舞","Dance of the Moonlight Jellies"]," festival each year. One Seafoam Pudding is part of the iridium tier reward on the 12th and 13th for the ",["l","鱿鱼节","SquidFest"]," festival, assuming the player already earned ",["l","捕蟹秘籍","The Art O' Crabbing"]," before from the festival. It can also be gifted by a ",["l","动物","pet"]," turtle with max ",["l","动物","friendship"],". It may also randomly appear at the ",["l","旅行货车","Traveling Cart"]," for 900–1,500g."]]]],["Gifting",2,[["t",[[{"h":1,"v":["Like"]},[["l","科罗布斯","Krobus"],", ",["l","威利","Willy"]]],[{"h":1,"v":["Hate"]},[["l","格斯","Gus"],", ",["l","哈维","Harvey"],", ",["l","皮埃尔","Pierre"],", ",["l","阿比盖尔","Abigail"],", ",["l","亚历克斯","Alex"],", ",["l","卡洛琳","Caroline"],", ",["l","克林特","Clint"],", ",["l","德米特里厄斯","Demetrius"],", ",["l","矮人","Dwarf"],", ",["l","艾利欧特","Elliott"],", ",["l","艾米丽","Emily"],", ",["l","艾芙琳","Evelyn"],", ",["l","乔治","George"],", ",["l","海莉","Haley"],", ",["l","贾斯","Jas"],", ",["l","乔迪","Jodi"],", ",["l","肯特","Kent"],", ",["l","莉亚","Leah"],", ",["l","刘易斯","Lewis"],", ",["l","莱纳斯","Linus"],", ",["l","玛妮","Marnie"],", ",["l","玛鲁","Maru"],", ",["l","潘姆","Pam"],", ",["l","潘妮","Penny"],", ",["l","罗宾","Robin"],", ",["l","山姆","Sam"],", ",["l","桑迪","Sandy"],", ",["l","塞巴斯蒂安","Sebastian"],", ",["l","谢恩","Shane"],", ",["l","文森特","Vincent"],", ",["l","法师","Wizard"],", ",["l","雷欧","Leo"]]]]]]],["Bundles",2,[["p",["Seafoam Pudding is not used in any ",["l","收集包","bundles"],"."]]]],["Recipes",2,[["p",["Seafoam Pudding is not used in any recipes."]]]],["Tailoring",2,[["p",["Seafoam Pudding is used in the spool of the ",["l","柳巷2号","Sewing Machine"]," to create the ",["l","裁缝","Mineral Dog Jacket"],". ",["f","Mineral_Dog_Jacket.png",24]," It can be used